@title Colin McRae Rally 2.0 (USA)
@file Colin McRae Rally 2.0 (U).gba
@game ACME
@chip EEPROM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: choosing Save on the stage menu before the first stage leaves the EEPROM blank in all three emulators; the next chance is after a finished stage, which needs steering a frozen timeline cannot do reliably
# English, Rally > Championship > New Game, Intermediate, one player, name
# PL1, Ford Focus, the default transmission, Rally Finland stage 1 (a detour
# through Quit > No and Save on the stage menu), then the race: full throttle
# off the road into the trees.
# Regression guard: before 2026-10-02 an S-bit write to r15 in System mode
# (the run-time library's `movs pc, lr`) restored a stale SPSR and came back
# in Thumb state (docs/playtest-bugs.md section 46): after the difficulty
# menu the HLE configuration soft-reset to the Spellbound logo and the
# official-BIOS one crashed into a garbage screen.

[new]
wait 600
wait 300
# until notblank timeout=1500 every=10  [reached dingbat-bios+10 mgba+10 nba+10]
wait 14
wait 120
wait 200
checkpoint title window=30
press START
wait 120
press A
wait 120
wait 120
checkpoint main_menu window=30
press A
wait 120
checkpoint mode_select window=30
press A
wait 120
press A
wait 120
checkpoint difficulty window=30
press A
wait 150
press A
wait 150
checkpoint name_entry window=30
press START
wait 150
press A
wait 150
checkpoint car_select window=30
press A
wait 200
press RIGHT
wait 20
press A
wait 200
checkpoint rally_finland window=30
press A
wait 200
press B
wait 60
press LEFT
wait 60
press A
wait 60
press RIGHT
wait 40
press RIGHT
wait 40
press RIGHT
wait 60
press RIGHT
wait 60
press A
wait 90
press RIGHT
wait 40
press RIGHT
wait 40
press RIGHT
wait 60
checkpoint race_menu window=30
press A
wait 300
checkpoint race_start window=30
wait 150
hold A
wait 400
checkpoint racing window=30
hold A+LEFT
wait 60
hold A
wait 300
# no checkpoint here: after the steer the car's position on dingbat leaves
# the references' (which agree; the lap timer still matches) -- the game runs
# close to its frame budget and the emulators lose frames at different
# points (docs/playtest-bugs.md section 29)
wait 60
release
